<title>ALBANIA: SOCCER-FINAL ALBANIAN RESULTS AND LEAGUE STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FINAL ALBANIAN RESULTS AND LEAGUE STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of an Albanian league</p>
<p>championship match after the national soccer federation handed</p>
<p>Tirana a 2-0 win over Flamurtari and stripped Flamurtari of four</p>
<p>points on Tuesday:</p>
<p> Flamurtari     0  Tirana	 2</p>
<p>Played on Sunday:</p>
<p> Vllaznia	 2  Apolonia     1</p>
<p> Partizani	3  Shkumbini    1</p>
<p>    Standings	 P   W   D  L   F   A  Pts</p>
<p> 1. Tirana	    22  14  4  4  40   9  46</p>
<p> 2. Vllaznia	  22  14  1  7  31  21  43</p>
<p> 3. Flamurtari	22  14  3  5  42  22  41</p>
<p> 4. Partizani	 22  12  4  6  28  21  40</p>
<p> 5. Apolonia	  22   9  4  9  26  27  31</p>
<p> 6. Shkumbini	 22   9  3 10  23  27  30</p>
</text>
